{
  "id": "club-signup",
  "title": "社團報名",
  "titleEn": "Signing Up for a School Club",
  "category": "同儕與社團",
  "level": "中級",
  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/club-signup.webp",
    "alt": "在熱鬧的學校社團博覽會上，男孩 Kevin 來到科學社攤位前，桌上擺著實驗模型與報名表，社員熱情地向他介紹社團活動。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "During the school club fair, Kevin walks over to the "
        },
        {
          "text": "science",
          "wordIds": [
            "science"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "club",
          "wordIds": [
            "club"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " booth."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "在學校社團博覽會上，Kevin 走到科學社的攤位前。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Curious about their projects, he smiles and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What do you do here?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-do-you-do-here"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他對他們的成果感到好奇，微笑著問道：「你們在這裡做些什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A friendly "
        },
        {
          "text": "member",
          "wordIds": [
            "member"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " replies, “We build models and plan a fun "
        },
        {
          "text": "activity",
          "wordIds": [
            "activity"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " every week.”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "一位友善的社員回答：「我們每週都會製作模型，並規劃有趣的活動。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Kevin is interested in the schedule and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "When do you meet?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "when-do-you-meet"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Kevin 對社團時間很感興趣，問道：「你們什麼時候聚會？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“We meet every Thursday after class in the lab,” the student explains."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「我們每週四放學後在實驗室聚會，」那位同學說明道。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Kevin is very excited and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "I'd like to ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-to-join-the-club"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "join",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-to-join-the-club"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "join"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-to-join-the-club"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "club",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-to-join-the-club"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "club"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "id-like-to-join-the-club"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Kevin 非常興奮並說道：「我想加入這個社團。」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Then he asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Where can I ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-can-i-sign-up"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sign",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-can-i-sign-up"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "sign"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " up?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "where-can-i-sign-up"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "” and takes a pen to "
        },
        {
          "text": "sign",
          "wordIds": [
            "sign"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " his name."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "接著他問道：「我可以在哪裡報名？」並拿起筆簽下自己的名字。"
    }
  ],
